{"name": "Ultra Smart Fusion v5 - Decision Engine", "description": "Fusion complete de Slarckvul RUSH + Showdown Survivor, avec une couche de decision explicite (World Model, Tracker, Predictor, Threat Map, Tactical/Aim Engine, Decision Engine, Action Planner, Memoire, gestion de performance adaptative). Garde toute l'agressivite et la recherche d'ennemis des deux styles d'origine tout en n'entrant jamais dans la tempete.", "brawlers": ["all"], "gamemodes": ["all"], "author": "PylaAI Fusion", "date": "2026-08-12"}

# ============================================================================
# ULTRA SMART FUSION v5 - DECISION ENGINE
#
# Fusion de "Slarckvul RUSH mode - Aggressive" (universal_smart_v5) et de
# "Showdown Survivor", avec par-dessus une architecture de decision explicite
# inspiree du pipeline complet demande dans le cahier des charges :
#
#   FRAME -> WORLD MODEL -> TRACKING / PREDICTION / THREAT MAP
#         -> TACTICAL ANALYSIS (aim / position / kill-opportunity)
#         -> DECISION ENGINE (score toutes les actions candidates)
#         -> ACTION PLANNER (coherence + urgences)
#         -> mouvement / attack / super / gadget
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LIMITES REELLES DU SANDBOX .pyla (important, lu directement dans utils.py) :
#
#  - Aucun `import` n'est autorise dans un script .pyla (is_safe_ast bloque
#    ast.Import/ImportFrom). Impossible donc d'utiliser threading/asyncio
#    pour un vrai parallelisme : ce script est execute de facon synchrone,
#    une fois par frame, par interpret_pyla_code(). "L'analyse simultanee"
#    demandee est donc implementee comme plusieurs etapes de calcul
#    INDEPENDANTES (elles ne se relisent pas entre elles avant la fin) et
#    non comme du multithreading reel.
#  - `__builtins__` est remplace par un dict VIDE dans le sandbox, et le
#    statement `class` repose sur la fonction `__build_class__` normalement
#    fournie par les builtins : DANS CE SANDBOX, DEFINIR UNE CLASSE LEVE UNE
#    NameError ("__build_class__ not found"). Les "classes internes"
#    (Tracker, Predictor, ThreatAnalyzer, DecisionEngine, ActionPlanner...)
#    demandees dans le cahier des charges sont donc implementees ici comme
#    des GROUPES DE FONCTIONS + DICTIONNAIRES dans persistent_data, avec le
#    meme decoupage logique/responsabilites qu'auraient de vraies classes.
#    Chaque section ci-dessous est commentee comme un "module".
#  - Pas de fichiers/logs sur disque (pas d'open()/import) : le "logging
#    structure" utilise print() (present dans SAFE_GLOBALS), avec des tags
#    ([TRACKING], [THREAT], [DECISION], [ACTION], [PERF]...), actif
#    uniquement si `debug` (fourni par le moteur) est vrai.
#  - Pas de donnees HP/munitions/objectif de mode de jeu dans le contexte
#    fourni par play.py (uniquement des boites player/enemy/teammate/wall,
#    plus des booleens is_super_ready / is_gadget_ready / is_hypercharge_ready
#    calcules par analyse de pixels). Les sections du cahier des charges qui
#    en dependent (#13 munitions, #15 kill via HP) sont donc implementees en
#    PROXY honnete : "opportunite d'engagement favorable" (LOS degagee,
#    cible proche, stable, peu de menace ambiante, multi-cibles a portee)
#    plutot qu'un vrai calcul de HP/munitions qui n'est pas mesurable ici.
# ============================================================================

_now = time.time()
_frame_start_time = _now

_brawler_name = brawler or current_brawler
_brawler_info = brawlers_info.get(_brawler_name)

if not _brawler_info:
    # [FALLBACK] (#48) : un `raise` ici stopperait interpret_pyla_code pour
    # de bon (et un `return` en haut de script est un SyntaxError, donc pas
    # d'echappatoire propre) -> on retombe sur un profil generique plutot
    # que de casser toute la frame de decision.
    _brawler_info = {
        "attack_range": 400, "safe_range": 200, "super_range": 400,
        "hold_attack": 0, "ignore_walls_for_attacks": False,
        "ignore_walls_for_supers": False, "super_type": "damage",
    }

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [WORLD MODEL / MEMORY] - etat persistant entre les frames
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
persistent_data.setdefault("time_since_holding_attack", None)
persistent_data.setdefault("last_gadget_use", 0.0)
persistent_data.setdefault("last_super_use", 0.0)
persistent_data.setdefault("last_hyper_use", 0.0)
persistent_data.setdefault("last_attack_time", 0.0)
persistent_data.setdefault("last_target", None)
persistent_data.setdefault("last_target_id", None)
persistent_data.setdefault("enemy_tracks", {})
persistent_data.setdefault("decision_history", [])          # memoire courte (#20)
persistent_data.setdefault("strategic_memory", {           # memoire longue (#21)
    "dodge_left_events": 0,
    "dodge_right_events": 0,
    "avg_enemy_speed": 0.0,
    "avg_enemy_speed_samples": 0,
    "storm_encounters": 0,
    "kill_opportunities_taken": 0,
})
persistent_data.setdefault("last_decision", "")
persistent_data.setdefault("last_decision_time", 0.0)
persistent_data.setdefault("last_action_scores", {})
persistent_data.setdefault("strafe_sign", 1)
persistent_data.setdefault("strafe_change", 0.0)
persistent_data.setdefault("explore_target", None)
persistent_data.setdefault("explore_target_time", 0.0)
persistent_data.setdefault("danger_score", 0.0)
persistent_data.setdefault("frame_counter", 0)
persistent_data.setdefault("last_player_pos", None)
persistent_data.setdefault("last_player_time", None)
persistent_data.setdefault("player_velocity", (0.0, 0.0))
persistent_data.setdefault("last_movement_vector", (0.0, 0.0))
persistent_data.setdefault("stuck_counter", 0)
persistent_data.setdefault("kite_phase", "engage")
persistent_data.setdefault("kite_phase_time", 0.0)
persistent_data.setdefault("was_in_storm", False)
# [PERFORMANCE MANAGER] (#33/#34/#35) - budget de calcul adaptatif
persistent_data.setdefault("perf_frame_times", [])
persistent_data.setdefault("perf_avg_ms", 8.0)
persistent_data.setdefault("perf_detail_level", 2)          # 0=minimal .. 2=complet
persistent_data.setdefault("last_strategic_update", 0.0)

persistent_data["frame_counter"] += 1
_frame_no = persistent_data["frame_counter"]


def _log(tag, message):
    # [LOGGING STRUCTURE] (#42/#43) : desactive par defaut, actif si le
    # moteur expose `debug=True` pour ce playstyle.
    if debug:
        print(f"[{tag}] frame={_frame_no} t={_now:.2f} {message}")


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Brawler characteristics / archetype
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
must_hold = must_brawler_hold_attack(_brawler_name, brawlers_info)
safe_range, attack_range, super_range = get_brawler_range(_brawler_name)
attack_range = float(attack_range or _brawler_info.get("attack_range", 400))
safe_range = float(safe_range or _brawler_info.get("safe_range", 200))
super_range = float(super_range or _brawler_info.get("super_range", attack_range))
player_pos = get_entity_pos(player_data)

_attack_range_raw = float(_brawler_info.get("attack_range", attack_range))
_safe_range_raw = float(_brawler_info.get("safe_range", safe_range))
_ignore_walls_attack = _brawler_info.get("ignore_walls_for_attacks", False)
_super_type = _brawler_info.get("super_type", "damage")

if _ignore_walls_attack:
    archetype = "LOBS"
elif _safe_range_raw == 0.0 and _attack_range_raw <= 350:
    archetype = "TANK"
elif _attack_range_raw <= 256:
    archetype = "ASSASSIN"
elif _attack_range_raw >= 600:
    archetype = "SNIPER"
else:
    archetype = "RANGED"

_kites = archetype in ("SNIPER", "RANGED")
_aggression_base = 0.85 if archetype in ("ASSASSIN", "TANK") else 0.65  # #17 aggression_level

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generic helpers
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
def clamp(v, lo, hi):
    return max(lo, min(hi, v))


def distance(a, b):
    if a is None or b is None:
        return 999999.0
    return math.hypot(a[0] - b[0], a[1] - b[1])


def norm(x, y, radius=JOYSTICK_RADIUS):
    d = math.hypot(x, y)
    if d <= 0.0001:
        return (0, 0)
    scale = float(radius) / d
    return (x * scale, y * scale)


def dot(ax, ay, bx, by):
    return ax * bx + ay * by


def box_center(box):
    if not box or len(box) < 4:
        return None
    return ((box[0] + box[2]) / 2.0, (box[1] + box[3]) / 2.0)


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [PERCEPTION LAYER - storm/gaz] Lecture unique par frame. _gas_escape est un
# vecteur normalise pointant vers la zone sure la plus proche, ou None.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
def _compute_gas_escape():
    gas = is_there_poison_gas(player_data)
    x = 0.0
    y = 0.0
    if gas.get("up", 0) or gas.get("down", 0):
        if gas.get("up", 0) > gas.get("down", 0):
            y = JOYSTICK_RADIUS
        else:
            y = -JOYSTICK_RADIUS
    if gas.get("left", 0) or gas.get("right", 0):
        if gas.get("left", 0) > gas.get("right", 0):
            x = JOYSTICK_RADIUS
        else:
            x = -JOYSTICK_RADIUS
    if x == 0 and y == 0:
        return None
    return norm(x, y)


_gas_escape = _compute_gas_escape()
if _gas_escape is not None and not persistent_data["was_in_storm"]:
    persistent_data["strategic_memory"]["storm_encounters"] += 1
persistent_data["was_in_storm"] = _gas_escape is not None


def safe_path(move):
    """Mur infranchissable OU mouvement qui rentre dans la tempete = refuse.
    Un mouvement tangentiel (produit scalaire ~0 avec la direction de
    fuite) reste autorise pour ne jamais casser la poursuite/l'agressivite."""
    if move is None:
        return False
    if is_path_blocked(player_data, move, walls):
        return False
    if _gas_escape is not None:
        align = dot(move[0], move[1], _gas_escape[0], _gas_escape[1])
        if align < 0:
            return False
    return True


def first_safe(options, fallback=(0, 0)):
    for m in options:
        if m is not None and safe_path(m):
            return m
    return fallback


def toward(pos, radius=JOYSTICK_RADIUS):
    if pos is None:
        return (0, 0)
    dx = pos[0] - player_pos[0]
    dy = pos[1] - player_pos[1]
    full = norm(dx, dy, radius)
    return first_safe([full, norm(dx, 0, radius), norm(0, dy, radius)], full)


def away(pos, radius=JOYSTICK_RADIUS):
    if pos is None:
        return (0, 0)
    dx = player_pos[0] - pos[0]
    dy = player_pos[1] - pos[1]
    full = norm(dx, dy, radius)
    return first_safe([full, norm(dx, 0, radius), norm(0, dy, radius)], full)


def away_from_vector(vx, vy, radius=JOYSTICK_RADIUS):
    full = norm(vx, vy, radius)
    return first_safe([full, norm(vx, 0, radius), norm(0, vy, radius)], full)


def strafe(pos, sign=None):
    if pos is None:
        return (0, 0)
    if sign is None:
        sign = persistent_data["strafe_sign"]
    dx = pos[0] - player_pos[0]
    dy = pos[1] - player_pos[1]
    sx = -dy * sign
    sy = dx * sign
    a = norm(sx, sy)
    b = norm(-sx, -sy)
    c = norm(dx, 0)
    d = norm(0, dy)
    return first_safe([a, b, c, d], a)


def reverse_strafe(pos):
    return strafe(pos, -persistent_data["strafe_sign"])


def random_safe():
    options = [
        (0, -JOYSTICK_RADIUS), (0, JOYSTICK_RADIUS),
        (-JOYSTICK_RADIUS, 0), (JOYSTICK_RADIUS, 0),
        norm(JOYSTICK_RADIUS, -JOYSTICK_RADIUS),
        norm(-JOYSTICK_RADIUS, -JOYSTICK_RADIUS),
        norm(JOYSTICK_RADIUS, JOYSTICK_RADIUS),
        norm(-JOYSTICK_RADIUS, JOYSTICK_RADIUS),
    ]
    random.shuffle(options)
    return first_safe(options, get_random_movement())


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [PLAYER STATE] estimation de la vitesse propre du joueur (utile pour aim
# et pour ne pas confondre notre propre mouvement avec celui de l'ennemi).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_prev_player = persistent_data.get("last_player_pos")
_prev_player_time = persistent_data.get("last_player_time")
if _prev_player is not None and _prev_player_time is not None:
    _dt_p = clamp(_now - _prev_player_time, 0.01, 0.5)
    _vx = (player_pos[0] - _prev_player[0]) / _dt_p
    _vy = (player_pos[1] - _prev_player[1]) / _dt_p
    _old_pv = persistent_data.get("player_velocity", (0, 0))
    persistent_data["player_velocity"] = (_old_pv[0] * 0.45 + _vx * 0.55, _old_pv[1] * 0.45 + _vy * 0.55)
persistent_data["last_player_pos"] = player_pos
persistent_data["last_player_time"] = _now

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [TRACKER MODULE] (#6) - association detection -> piste + estimation de
# vitesse/acceleration a lissage adaptatif + score de stabilite + score de
# confiance explicite (#24).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
tracks = persistent_data["enemy_tracks"]
seen_track_ids = []
current_enemies = []

for idx in range(len(enemy_data)):
    box = enemy_data[idx]
    p = box_center(box)
    if p is not None:
        current_enemies.append((idx, p, box))

for idx, pos, box in current_enemies:
    best_id = None
    best_dist = 999999.0
    for tid, tr in tracks.items():
        if tid in seen_track_ids:
            continue
        old_pos = tr.get("pos")
        if old_pos is None:
            continue
        d = distance(pos, old_pos)
        gate = max(TILE_SIZE * 3.0, 160.0)
        if d <= gate and d < best_dist:
            best_dist = d
            best_id = tid

    if best_id is None:
        best_id = "e" + str(idx) + "_" + str(_frame_no)
        tracks[best_id] = {
            "pos": pos, "prev_pos": pos, "velocity": (0.0, 0.0), "acceleration": (0.0, 0.0),
            "time": _now, "seen": 1, "last_seen": _now, "stability": 0.0, "confidence": 0.25,
            "radial_speed": 0.0, "tangential_speed": 0.0,
        }
    else:
        tr = tracks[best_id]
        dt = clamp(_now - tr.get("time", _now), 0.01, 0.5)
        old_velocity = tr.get("velocity", (0, 0))
        vx = (pos[0] - tr.get("pos", pos)[0]) / dt
        vy = (pos[1] - tr.get("pos", pos)[1]) / dt

        seen_count = tr.get("seen", 0)
        alpha = clamp(0.65 - seen_count * 0.03, 0.30, 0.65)
        velocity = (old_velocity[0] * (1.0 - alpha) + vx * alpha, old_velocity[1] * (1.0 - alpha) + vy * alpha)
        ax = (velocity[0] - old_velocity[0]) / dt
        ay = (velocity[1] - old_velocity[1]) / dt

        old_speed = math.hypot(old_velocity[0], old_velocity[1])
        new_speed = math.hypot(velocity[0], velocity[1])
        if old_speed > 15 and new_speed > 15:
            cos_between = clamp(dot(old_velocity[0], old_velocity[1], velocity[0], velocity[1]) / (old_speed * new_speed), -1.0, 1.0)
            straightness = (cos_between + 1.0) / 2.0
        else:
            straightness = 0.5
        tr["stability"] = tr.get("stability", 0.0) * 0.7 + straightness * 0.3

        # [CONFIANCE] (#24) : monte avec l'anciennete et la regularite de la
        # piste, redescend si elle vient d'etre retrouvee apres une longue
        # occlusion (0 nouvelle observation ne vaut pas une piste fraiche).
        recency = clamp(1.0 - (dt - 0.15) / 1.2, 0.0, 1.0)
        age_conf = clamp(seen_count / 12.0, 0.0, 1.0)
        tr["confidence"] = clamp(0.5 * age_conf + 0.3 * tr["stability"] + 0.2 * recency, 0.05, 0.98)

        tr["prev_pos"] = tr.get("pos", pos)
        tr["pos"] = pos
        tr["velocity"] = velocity
        tr["acceleration"] = (clamp(ax, -2000.0, 2000.0) * 0.3, clamp(ay, -2000.0, 2000.0) * 0.3)
        tr["time"] = _now
        tr["last_seen"] = _now
        tr["seen"] = seen_count + 1

    seen_track_ids.append(best_id)
    tracks[best_id]["box"] = box

_stale_tracks = []
for tid in tracks:
    if _now - tracks[tid].get("last_seen", _now) > 1.6:
        _stale_tracks.append(tid)
for tid in _stale_tracks:
    del tracks[tid]

_log("TRACKING", f"active_tracks={len(seen_track_ids)}")

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [PREDICTOR MODULE] (#7) - plusieurs horizons, ponderes par la stabilite de
# la piste (une piste instable est projetee moins loin).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
def predicted_position(track, horizon):
    p = track.get("pos")
    v = track.get("velocity", (0, 0))
    a = track.get("acceleration", (0, 0))
    if p is None:
        return None
    stability = track.get("stability", 0.5)
    h = horizon * clamp(0.4 + stability, 0.4, 1.0)
    return (p[0] + v[0] * h + 0.5 * a[0] * h * h, p[1] + v[1] * h + 0.5 * a[1] * h * h)


def predicted_enemy_positions(track):
    # 100 / 220 / 380 / 600 ms (#7)
    return [predicted_position(track, 0.10), predicted_position(track, 0.22),
            predicted_position(track, 0.38), predicted_position(track, 0.60)]


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [BEHAVIOR CLASSIFIER] (#8) - a partir du vecteur vitesse relatif au joueur,
# estime si l'ennemi approche, fuit, ou se repositionne, avec une "confiance"
# (probabilite heuristique, pas un vrai modele appris).
# NOTE : aucune donnee de HP/munitions/cooldown adverse n'est fournie par le
# moteur -> impossible d'estimer une probabilite d'usage de super adverse de
# facon honnete ; cette partie du cahier des charges (#8, super adverse)
# n'est donc PAS simulee ici plutot que d'etre inventee.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
def classify_behavior(track):
    p = track.get("pos")
    v = track.get("velocity", (0, 0))
    speed = math.hypot(v[0], v[1])
    if p is None or speed < 25:
        return {"state": "IDLE", "approach": 0.2, "flee": 0.2, "reposition": 0.6}

    dx = player_pos[0] - p[0]
    dy = player_pos[1] - p[1]
    dd = math.hypot(dx, dy)
    if dd < 0.0001:
        return {"state": "IDLE", "approach": 0.2, "flee": 0.2, "reposition": 0.6}

    ux, uy = dx / dd, dy / dd
    radial = dot(v[0], v[1], ux, uy)                 # >0 = vient vers le joueur
    tangential = math.hypot(v[0] - radial * ux, v[1] - radial * uy)

    track["radial_speed"] = radial
    track["tangential_speed"] = tangential

    approach_raw = max(0.0, radial)
    flee_raw = max(0.0, -radial)
    reposition_raw = tangential * 0.6
    total = approach_raw + flee_raw + reposition_raw
    if total < 1.0:
        return {"state": "IDLE", "approach": 0.2, "flee": 0.2, "reposition": 0.6}

    approach = approach_raw / total
    flee = flee_raw / total
    reposition = reposition_raw / total
    if approach >= flee and approach >= reposition:
        state = "APPROACHING"
    elif flee >= approach and flee >= reposition:
        state = "FLEEING"
    else:
        state = "REPOSITIONING"
    return {"state": state, "approach": approach, "flee": flee, "reposition": reposition}


for tid in seen_track_ids:
    tracks[tid]["behavior"] = classify_behavior(tracks[tid])

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [TARGET SELECTION] avec hysteresis explicite pour eviter le flicker.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_TARGET_SWITCH_MARGIN = 12.0


def target_score(track):
    pos = track.get("pos")
    if pos is None:
        return -999999.0
    d = distance(player_pos, pos)
    score = 0.0

    if d <= attack_range:
        score += 34.0
    elif d <= attack_range * 1.25:
        score += 17.0
    else:
        score -= min(25.0, (d - attack_range) / max(1.0, TILE_SIZE))

    if d < safe_range:
        score += 42.0
    elif d < safe_range * 1.35:
        score += 17.0

    v = track.get("velocity", (0, 0))
    score += min(16.0, math.hypot(v[0], v[1]) / 25.0)
    score += track.get("stability", 0.0) * 10.0
    score += track.get("confidence", 0.3) * 12.0  # #24 : cibles peu fiables sont moins prioritaires

    behavior = track.get("behavior", {})
    if behavior.get("state") == "FLEEING":
        score += 6.0   # finir un ennemi qui fuit = opportunite
    elif behavior.get("state") == "APPROACHING":
        score += 10.0  # menace directe = priorite

    try:
        if is_enemy_hittable(player_pos, pos, walls, "attack"):
            score += 24.0
        else:
            score -= 8.0
    except:
        pass

    if persistent_data.get("last_target") is not None:
        if distance(persistent_data["last_target"], pos) < TILE_SIZE * 2.5:
            score += 20.0

    return score


_best_track, _best_track_id, _best_score = None, None, -999999.0
for tid in seen_track_ids:
    tr = tracks.get(tid)
    if tr is None:
        continue
    sc = target_score(tr)
    if sc > _best_score:
        _best_score, _best_track, _best_track_id = sc, tr, tid

_prev_id = persistent_data.get("last_target_id")
if _prev_id is not None and _prev_id in tracks and _best_track_id != _prev_id:
    _prev_tr = tracks[_prev_id]
    _prev_sc = target_score(_prev_tr)
    if _prev_sc >= _best_score - _TARGET_SWITCH_MARGIN:
        _best_track, _best_track_id, _best_score = _prev_tr, _prev_id, _prev_sc

enemy_coords = None
enemy_distance = None
if _best_track is not None:
    enemy_coords = _best_track.get("pos")
    enemy_distance = distance(player_pos, enemy_coords)
elif is_there_enemy(enemy_data):
    enemy_coords, enemy_distance = find_closest_enemy(enemy_data, player_pos, walls, "attack")

if enemy_coords is not None:
    persistent_data["last_target"] = enemy_coords
    persistent_data["last_target_id"] = _best_track_id

_log("DECISION", f"target={enemy_coords} score={_best_score:.1f} archetype={archetype}")

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [THREAT MAP MODULE] (#9) - score scalaire ET vecteur de menace combine
# (tous les ennemis suivis contribuent, pas seulement la cible principale).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
def threat_score(track):
    p = track.get("pos")
    if p is None:
        return 0.0
    d = distance(player_pos, p)
    if d <= 1:
        return 100.0
    proximity = clamp(1.0 - d / max(attack_range * 1.7, 1.0), 0.0, 1.0)
    speed = math.hypot(track.get("velocity", (0, 0))[0], track.get("velocity", (0, 0))[1])
    movement_threat = clamp(speed / 250.0, 0.0, 1.0)
    los = 0.0
    try:
        if is_enemy_hittable(player_pos, p, walls, "attack"):
            los = 1.0
    except:
        pass
    behavior_bonus = 12.0 if track.get("behavior", {}).get("state") == "APPROACHING" else 0.0
    confidence = track.get("confidence", 0.3)
    return (proximity * 55.0 + movement_threat * 15.0 + los * 30.0 + behavior_bonus) * clamp(0.4 + confidence, 0.4, 1.0)


total_threat = 0.0
threat_vec_x = 0.0
threat_vec_y = 0.0
threats_in_super_range = 0
threats_in_attack_range = 0
for tid in seen_track_ids:
    tr = tracks.get(tid)
    if tr is None:
        continue
    ts = threat_score(tr)
    total_threat += ts
    p = tr.get("pos")
    if p is not None:
        dx, dy = player_pos[0] - p[0], player_pos[1] - p[1]
        dd = math.hypot(dx, dy)
        if dd > 0.0001:
            threat_vec_x += (dx / dd) * ts
            threat_vec_y += (dy / dd) * ts
        d_here = distance(player_pos, p)
        if d_here <= super_range:
            threats_in_super_range += 1
        if d_here <= attack_range:
            threats_in_attack_range += 1

total_threat = clamp(total_threat, 0.0, 160.0)
persistent_data["danger_score"] = total_threat
_log("THREAT", f"total={total_threat:.1f} vec=({threat_vec_x:.0f},{threat_vec_y:.0f}) in_super={threats_in_super_range}")

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [AIM SYSTEM] (#12) - horizon de prediction choisi selon la stabilite,
# avec repli sur la position confirmee si la position predite n'a plus de
# ligne de vue (mieux vaut viser une position confirmee qu'une prediction
# qui traverse temporairement un mur).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_predicted_target = enemy_coords
if _best_track is not None:
    candidates = predicted_enemy_positions(_best_track)
    stability = _best_track.get("stability", 0.5)
    start_idx = 0 if stability < 0.35 else 1
    for p in candidates[start_idx:start_idx + 2]:
        if p is not None:
            _predicted_target = p
            break


def hit_probability(track):
    """Probabilite de toucher approximee (#12/#13) : stabilite de la piste,
    confiance de detection, distance relative a la portee ideale."""
    if track is None:
        return 0.5
    stability = track.get("stability", 0.5)
    confidence = track.get("confidence", 0.3)
    d = distance(player_pos, track.get("pos", player_pos))
    range_factor = clamp(1.0 - abs(d - attack_range * 0.6) / max(attack_range, 1.0), 0.15, 1.0)
    return clamp(0.25 + 0.35 * stability + 0.2 * confidence + 0.2 * range_factor, 0.05, 0.97)


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Showdown exploration / cohesion d'equipe (reprend Showdown Survivor).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
def no_enemy_movement():
    closest, dist = find_closest_teammate(teammate_data, player_pos, walls)
    if closest is not None:
        if dist is not None and dist < TILE_SIZE * 0.9:
            return first_safe([strafe(closest), reverse_strafe(closest), (0, 0)], (0, 0))
        if dist is None or dist > TILE_SIZE * 2.8:
            return toward(closest)

    cx, cy = width / 2.0, height / 2.0
    center = (cx, cy)
    if distance(player_pos, center) < TILE_SIZE * 2:
        if persistent_data["explore_target"] is None or _now - persistent_data["explore_target_time"] > 2.0:
            persistent_data["explore_target"] = (cx + random.randint(-TILE_SIZE, TILE_SIZE), cy + random.randint(-TILE_SIZE, TILE_SIZE))
            persistent_data["explore_target_time"] = _now
        return toward(persistent_data["explore_target"])
    return toward(center)


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Combat helpers (attack / super / gadget)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
def do_attack():
    if not must_hold:
        attack()
        persistent_data["last_attack_time"] = _now
        return
    hold_time = float(_brawler_info.get("hold_attack", 0.0))
    if persistent_data["time_since_holding_attack"] is None:
        persistent_data["time_since_holding_attack"] = _now
        attack(touch_up=False, touch_down=True)
    elif _now - persistent_data["time_since_holding_attack"] >= hold_time:
        attack(touch_up=True, touch_down=False)
        persistent_data["time_since_holding_attack"] = None
        persistent_data["last_attack_time"] = _now


if must_hold and persistent_data["time_since_holding_attack"] is not None:
    hold_limit = float(_brawler_info.get("hold_attack", 0.0)) + float(seconds_to_hold_attack_after_reaching_max)
    if _now - persistent_data["time_since_holding_attack"] >= hold_limit:
        attack(touch_up=True, touch_down=False)
        persistent_data["time_since_holding_attack"] = None


# [KILL / SHOT OPPORTUNITY] (#13/#15) proxy honnete (pas de HP disponible) :
# une "opportunite" = cible proche + tres bonne proba de toucher + LOS
# degagee + faible danger ambiant (on ne prend pas un risque inutile pour un
# tir non garanti), eventuellement plusieurs cibles a portee.
def engagement_opportunity_score(track, d):
    if track is None:
        return 0.0
    p_hit = hit_probability(track)
    score = p_hit * 40.0
    if d < attack_range * 0.6:
        score += 15.0
    if total_threat < 45:
        score += 12.0
    if threats_in_attack_range >= 2:
        score += 10.0
    return score


def super_value(target, d):
    if not is_super_ready or target is None:
        return 0.0
    try:
        if not is_enemy_hittable(player_pos, target, walls, "super") and not _brawler_info.get("ignore_walls_for_supers", False):
            return 0.0
    except:
        return 0.0

    value = 0.0
    if d <= super_range:
        value += 60.0
    elif _super_type in ["spawnable", "other"]:
        value += 35.0
    elif _brawler_name in ["stu", "surge"] and _super_type == "charge" and d <= super_range + attack_range:
        value += 55.0
    else:
        return 0.0

    if total_threat > 75:
        value += 20.0
    if d < safe_range:
        value += 18.0
    if threats_in_super_range >= 2:
        value += 12.0 * min(threats_in_super_range - 1, 3)
    value += engagement_opportunity_score(_best_track, d) * 0.2
    return value


def try_use_super(target, d):
    if target is None or persistent_data["time_since_holding_attack"] is not None:
        return False
    value = super_value(target, d)
    if value < 55.0 or _now - persistent_data["last_super_use"] < 1.0:
        return False
    if is_hypercharge_ready and value >= 78.0 and _now - persistent_data["last_hyper_use"] >= 1.0:
        use_hypercharge()
        persistent_data["last_hyper_use"] = _now
    use_super()
    persistent_data["last_super_use"] = _now
    persistent_data["last_decision"] = "SUPER"
    persistent_data["last_decision_time"] = _now
    _log("ACTION", f"SUPER value={value:.1f}")
    return True


def attack_value(target, d, allow_wall=False):
    if target is None or d > attack_range:
        return 0.0
    visible = allow_wall
    try:
        visible = visible or is_enemy_hittable(player_pos, target, walls, "attack")
    except:
        pass
    if not visible and enemy_coords is not None and target != enemy_coords:
        try:
            visible = visible or is_enemy_hittable(player_pos, enemy_coords, walls, "attack")
        except:
            pass
    if not visible:
        return 0.0

    value = 45.0
    if d < safe_range:
        value += 15.0
    if d <= attack_range * 0.75:
        value += 15.0
    if total_threat > 100:
        value += 8.0
    value += engagement_opportunity_score(_best_track, d) * 0.35
    return value


def try_attack(target, d, allow_wall=False):
    value = attack_value(target, d, allow_wall)
    if value <= 0:
        return False
    if is_gadget_ready and persistent_data["time_since_holding_attack"] is None:
        if _now - persistent_data["last_gadget_use"] >= 3.0 and (d < safe_range or total_threat > 85):
            use_gadget()
            persistent_data["last_gadget_use"] = _now
    do_attack()
    persistent_data["last_decision"] = "ATTACK"
    persistent_data["last_decision_time"] = _now
    if value >= 90.0:
        persistent_data["strategic_memory"]["kill_opportunities_taken"] += 1
    _log("ACTION", f"ATTACK value={value:.1f}")
    return True


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [KITE CYCLE] pour archetypes a distance : phase engage/retreat explicite
# plutot qu'un simple scoring frame-a-frame.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
def update_kite_phase(target_distance):
    if not _kites or target_distance is None:
        persistent_data["kite_phase"] = "engage"
        return
    just_attacked = (_now - persistent_data.get("last_attack_time", 0.0)) < 0.35
    too_close = target_distance < safe_range * 1.1
    if persistent_data["kite_phase"] == "engage":
        if just_attacked or too_close:
            persistent_data["kite_phase"] = "retreat"
            persistent_data["kite_phase_time"] = _now
    else:
        if _now - persistent_data["kite_phase_time"] > 0.55 and not too_close:
            persistent_data["kite_phase"] = "engage"


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [TACTICAL / POSITION SCORING] (#11) - chaque direction candidate est notee.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
def candidate_score(move, target, target_distance):
    if move is None or not safe_path(move):
        return -99999.0
    d = math.hypot(move[0], move[1])
    if d < 1:
        return -2.0

    score = 0.0
    tx, ty = move

    if _gas_escape is not None:
        score += dot(tx, ty, _gas_escape[0], _gas_escape[1]) / max(1.0, JOYSTICK_RADIUS) * 80.0

    if target is not None:
        if archetype == "ASSASSIN":
            desired = attack_range * 0.45
        elif archetype == "TANK":
            desired = attack_range * 0.30
        elif archetype == "SNIPER":
            desired = attack_range * (0.85 if persistent_data["kite_phase"] == "retreat" else 0.60)
        elif archetype == "LOBS":
            desired = attack_range * 0.58
        elif archetype == "RANGED":
            desired = attack_range * (0.78 if persistent_data["kite_phase"] == "retreat" else 0.55)
        else:
            desired = attack_range * 0.62

        projected_player = (player_pos[0] + tx * 0.55, player_pos[1] + ty * 0.55)
        future_dist = distance(projected_player, target)
        score -= abs(future_dist - desired) * 0.16

        try:
            if is_enemy_hittable(projected_player, target, walls, "attack"):
                score += 20.0
        except:
            pass

        enemy_v = _best_track.get("velocity", (0, 0)) if _best_track else (0, 0)
        enemy_speed = math.hypot(enemy_v[0], enemy_v[1])
        if enemy_speed > 30:
            ux, uy = enemy_v[0] / enemy_speed, enemy_v[1] / enemy_speed
            lateral = abs(dot(tx, ty, -uy, ux)) / max(1.0, JOYSTICK_RADIUS)
            score += lateral * 18.0

        if target_distance < safe_range or total_threat > 70:
            tv_norm = math.hypot(threat_vec_x, threat_vec_y)
            if tv_norm > 0.0001:
                score += dot(tx, ty, threat_vec_x / tv_norm, threat_vec_y / tv_norm) * 34.0

    last_move = persistent_data.get("last_movement_vector", (0, 0))
    if distance(move, last_move) < 5:
        score -= 8.0
    score += min(d, JOYSTICK_RADIUS) * 0.04
    return score


def choose_tactical_move(target, target_distance):
    candidates = []
    if target is not None:
        candidates.extend([
            toward(target), away(target), strafe(target), reverse_strafe(target),
            norm(target[0] - player_pos[0], 0), norm(0, target[1] - player_pos[1]),
            norm(player_pos[0] - target[0], 0), norm(0, player_pos[1] - target[1]),
        ])
        if math.hypot(threat_vec_x, threat_vec_y) > 0.0001:
            candidates.append(away_from_vector(threat_vec_x, threat_vec_y))
    else:
        candidates.append(no_enemy_movement())

    candidates.extend([
        (0, -JOYSTICK_RADIUS), (0, JOYSTICK_RADIUS), (-JOYSTICK_RADIUS, 0), (JOYSTICK_RADIUS, 0),
        norm(JOYSTICK_RADIUS, JOYSTICK_RADIUS), norm(-JOYSTICK_RADIUS, JOYSTICK_RADIUS),
        norm(JOYSTICK_RADIUS, -JOYSTICK_RADIUS), norm(-JOYSTICK_RADIUS, -JOYSTICK_RADIUS),
    ])

    best, best_score = (0, 0), -999999.0
    for move_option in candidates:
        sc = candidate_score(move_option, target, target_distance)
        if sc > best_score:
            best_score, best = sc, move_option
    return best, best_score


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [DECISION ENGINE] (#3) - scoring explicite des grandes familles d'action,
# pour piloter les priorites (#19) et pour le log de decision (#42).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
def compute_priority_scores(target_distance):
    """Retourne un score par grande categorie d'action (#19). HP indisponible
    -> SURVIVAL se base sur le danger ambiant / proximite plutot que sur les
    PV reels."""
    survival = total_threat * 1.0 + (40.0 if (target_distance is not None and target_distance < safe_range * 0.7) else 0.0)
    kill = engagement_opportunity_score(_best_track, target_distance) if target_distance is not None else 0.0
    objective = 0.0  # aucune donnee d'objectif de mode de jeu exposee par le moteur
    position = 20.0 if (target_distance is not None and (target_distance > attack_range * 1.3 or target_distance < safe_range * 0.5)) else 8.0
    attack_prio = 30.0 if (target_distance is not None and target_distance <= attack_range) else 0.0
    chase = 18.0 if (target_distance is not None and attack_range < target_distance <= attack_range * 2.0) else 0.0
    return {
        "SURVIVAL": survival, "KILL": kill, "OBJECTIVE": objective,
        "POSITION": position, "ATTACK": attack_prio, "CHASE": chase,
    }


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [PERFORMANCE MANAGER] (#33/#34) - mesure du temps de calcul et adaptation
# du niveau de detail pour les prochaines frames (pas de vrai multi-frequence
# possible sans threads, mais on peut throttler les etapes couteuses).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
def update_performance(elapsed_ms):
    times = persistent_data["perf_frame_times"]
    times.append(elapsed_ms)
    if len(times) > 30:
        del times[:-30]
    avg = sum(times) / len(times)
    persistent_data["perf_avg_ms"] = avg
    if avg > 22.0:
        persistent_data["perf_detail_level"] = 0
    elif avg > 12.0:
        persistent_data["perf_detail_level"] = 1
    else:
        persistent_data["perf_detail_level"] = 2
    _log("PERF", f"avg_ms={avg:.2f} detail_level={persistent_data['perf_detail_level']}")


# [STRATEGIC MEMORY UPDATE] (#21/#22) - throttled a ~5 Hz (#32) pour ne pas
# recalculer une statistique globale a chaque frame.
if _now - persistent_data["last_strategic_update"] > 0.2:
    sm = persistent_data["strategic_memory"]
    for tid in seen_track_ids:
        tr = tracks.get(tid)
        if tr is None:
            continue
        speed = math.hypot(tr.get("velocity", (0, 0))[0], tr.get("velocity", (0, 0))[1])
        if speed > 20:
            n = sm["avg_enemy_speed_samples"]
            sm["avg_enemy_speed"] = (sm["avg_enemy_speed"] * n + speed) / (n + 1)
            sm["avg_enemy_speed_samples"] = min(n + 1, 500)
        tangential = tr.get("tangential_speed", 0.0)
        if abs(tangential) > 40:
            radial_ref = tr.get("radial_speed", 0.0)
            # signe approximatif du cote de contournement (heuristique globale, pas par-identite)
            if tangential > 0:
                sm["dodge_right_events"] += 1
            else:
                sm["dodge_left_events"] += 1
    persistent_data["last_strategic_update"] = _now

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [STRATEGY LAYER] biais global (#22/#23) : si l'echantillon est suffisant,
# on privilegie legerement le cote vers lequel les ennemis rencontres se
# deplacent le plus souvent lateralement, pour des strafes un peu moins
# previsibles / plus alignes avec ce qu'on a observe ce match.
def strategic_strafe_bias():
    sm = persistent_data["strategic_memory"]
    total = sm["dodge_left_events"] + sm["dodge_right_events"]
    if total < 12:
        return None
    return 1 if sm["dodge_right_events"] >= sm["dodge_left_events"] else -1


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [ACTION PLANNER] (#38/#39/#40) - couche finale : resout les urgences et
# empeche les actions incoherentes avant d'envoyer le mouvement final.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
update_kite_phase(enemy_distance)
priority_scores = compute_priority_scores(enemy_distance)
persistent_data["last_action_scores"] = priority_scores
_log("DECISION", f"priorities={priority_scores}")

movement = (0, 0)
anti_gas = None if _gas_escape is None else first_safe(
    [_gas_escape, norm(_gas_escape[0], 0), norm(0, _gas_escape[1]), reverse_strafe(enemy_coords)], _gas_escape
)

# [EMERGENCY SYSTEM] (#40/#41) : danger critique au contact -> priorite
# absolue a l'esquive/au retrait, court-circuite le scoring tactique normal
# (mais respecte toujours le filtre "jamais dans la tempete").
_emergency = enemy_coords is not None and enemy_distance is not None and (
    enemy_distance < safe_range * 0.55 and total_threat > 95
)

if anti_gas is not None:
    movement = anti_gas
    persistent_data["last_decision"] = "ESCAPE_STORM"
    if enemy_coords is not None:
        try_use_super(_predicted_target, enemy_distance)
        try_attack(_predicted_target, enemy_distance, allow_wall=(archetype == "LOBS"))

elif _emergency:
    movement = first_safe([reverse_strafe(enemy_coords), strafe(enemy_coords), away(enemy_coords)], away(enemy_coords))
    persistent_data["last_decision"] = "EMERGENCY_DODGE"
    try_use_super(_predicted_target, enemy_distance)
    try_attack(_predicted_target, enemy_distance, allow_wall=(archetype == "LOBS"))

else:
    if enemy_coords is None:
        movement, _mv_score = choose_tactical_move(None, 999999.0)
        persistent_data["last_decision"] = "EXPLORE_OR_FOLLOW"
    else:
        try_use_super(_predicted_target, enemy_distance)
        try_attack(_predicted_target, enemy_distance, allow_wall=(archetype == "LOBS"))
        movement, _mv_score = choose_tactical_move(_predicted_target, enemy_distance)
        persistent_data["last_decision"] = "COMBAT_MOVE"

# [Adaptive strafe direction] - change lentement, biaise par la memoire
# strategique quand un cote clair a ete observe ce match (#22).
if enemy_coords is not None and _now - persistent_data["strafe_change"] > 1.25:
    bias = strategic_strafe_bias()
    left_ok = safe_path(strafe(enemy_coords, -1))
    right_ok = safe_path(strafe(enemy_coords, 1))
    if left_ok and not right_ok:
        persistent_data["strafe_sign"] = -1
    elif right_ok and not left_ok:
        persistent_data["strafe_sign"] = 1
    elif bias is not None:
        persistent_data["strafe_sign"] = bias
    else:
        persistent_data["strafe_sign"] *= -1
    persistent_data["strafe_change"] = _now

# [Stuck detection / recovery] (#41)
if movement is None:
    movement = (0, 0)

if is_path_blocked(player_data, movement, walls):
    persistent_data["stuck_counter"] += 1
    movement = first_safe([
        strafe(enemy_coords), reverse_strafe(enemy_coords), random_safe(),
        (0, -JOYSTICK_RADIUS), (JOYSTICK_RADIUS, 0), (0, JOYSTICK_RADIUS), (-JOYSTICK_RADIUS, 0),
    ], (0, 0))
else:
    persistent_data["stuck_counter"] = max(0, persistent_data["stuck_counter"] - 1)

if persistent_data["stuck_counter"] >= 3:
    movement = random_safe()
    persistent_data["stuck_counter"] = 0
    persistent_data["last_decision"] = "RECOVER_STUCK"

movement = norm(movement[0], movement[1]) if movement is not None else (0, 0)
persistent_data["last_movement_vector"] = movement
_log("ACTION", f"final_decision={persistent_data['last_decision']} movement={movement}")

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [MEMOIRE COURTE] (#20) - historique borne des dernieres decisions.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
history = persistent_data["decision_history"]
history.append({
    "time": _now, "decision": persistent_data.get("last_decision", ""), "target": enemy_coords,
    "danger": total_threat, "priorities": priority_scores, "movement": movement,
})
if len(history) > 20:
    del history[:-20]

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [PERFORMANCE MANAGER] mesure du temps total de cette frame de decision.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
update_performance((time.time() - _frame_start_time) * 1000.0)
